  "body": "Motivated vendor, surplus to requirements.\r\nAn exceptional opportunity awaits to secure this one-bedroom affordable apartment with a balcony and versatile study (previously utilised as a small bedroom), on Level 7 of the iconic Nautilus building.\r\nEnjoy breathtaking views across the beach, estuary, and surrounding hinterland. This beautifully presented apartment is ideal as a holiday escape, a permanent residence, or a smart investment option.\r\nResidents can take advantage of outstanding on-site facilities, including a heated resort-style pool, spa, sauna, and fully equipped gym.\r\nPerfectly positioned, the building is just a short stroll to Orewa’s shops, cafes, stunning beach, and an array of other local amenities—making the location truly unbeatable.",
